RepoWiki licensing overview
===========================

Except for files or components that carry their own license notices, original
RepoWiki material is licensed under the MIT License below. In particular:

- RepoWiki's Rust source, prompts, and documentation are licensed under MIT.
- The RepoWiki DokuWiki integration in `engine/dokuwiki/` is licensed under
  GPL-2.0-or-later. See `engine/dokuwiki/plugins/repowiki/LICENSE` for the full
  license text.
- Third-party components in `vendor/dokuwiki/` retain their upstream licenses
  and notices. This includes DokuWiki and the Mermaid plugin under GPLv2,
  Mermaid.js under MIT, and Composer-managed dependencies under their own
  licenses.

